day-one-posts.md

# Raw photos and videos he dropped in. Only processed, approved files go in public/.
/media/

# Switzer is fetched at build time (ITF licence forbids redistributing the files).
/public/fonts/switzer/

# Local only: the parked garden build (other photos, personal data) and the design
# notes, which quote his private answers. This repo is public.
/_parked/
/docs/

# The publishing room ships its env names (no values).
!.env.example
